---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Franchise"
  description="A franchise enquiry for Lavya, the unisex salon and spa in Patrapada, Bhubaneswar."
>
  <header class="editorial-hero">
    <svg class="editorial-hero__strand" viewBox="0 0 600 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <path
        data-strand
        d="M 500 -40 C 360 140 540 260 420 380 C 320 480 160 440 180 560 C 196 660 340 660 470 610"
      ></path>
    </svg>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">Franchise</p>
      <h1 class="editorial-hero__title display" data-split="lines">Bring Lavya to your city.</h1>
      <p class="editorial-hero__lede" data-reveal="up">
        We are opening a small number of conversations with operators who want to run a Lavya
        salon and spa in their city. It starts with a call, not a contract.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="editorial-body">
    <div class="wrap editorial-grid">
      <div class="editorial-grid__main prose">
        <p>
          Lavya is a unisex salon and spa built on a simple standard: one team for the whole
          family, one consultation before any service, and a room calm enough to spend an hour
          in. We are careful about where that standard travels.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you already run a salon, or you are planning one, and the way we work fits how you
          want to work, write to us. We will ask about your city, your space, your team and your
          timeline before we talk about anything else.
        </p>

        <h2>What a first conversation covers</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The location, the size of the space and the neighbourhood around it.</li>
          <li>The team you have, or the team you plan to build.</li>
          <li>The services you want to lead with, and the ones you would add later.</li>
          <li>How you would keep the consultation and aftercare standard consistent.</li>
          <li>Your timeline, and what you need from us to make a decision.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What we are not</h2>
        <p>
          This is not a turnkey package with a fixed fee published on a page. Terms are
          discussed individually, in writing, and only after both sides have seen the space and
          the plan. If that sounds slow, it is meant to.
        </p>

        <div class="editorial-image" data-reveal="scale">
          <img
            src="/images/grooming.webp"
            width="220"
            height="220"
            alt="A short, shaped haircut and beard in the salon."
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="editorial-grid__side">
        <div class="enquiry">
          <h2>Start an enquiry</h2>
          <p>
            Send your city, the address of the space if you have one, and a phone number. We
            will reply from the salon.
          </p>
          <a
            class="btn btn--solid"
            href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Franchise%20enquiry`}
          >
            Email the team
            <svg class="btn__arrow" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M2 10 10 2M4 2h6v6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
            Or call <a class="inline-link" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
